Subject: [PATCH 08/71] refactor: refactor multiple functions and enhance log
 readability

To improve overall clarigy and maintainability:
- refactor the following functions:
    - NoAccountAlloc()
    - CalNrPagesPerLocalNuma()
    - CalRemotePerLocalWithAccount()
- extract ratio calculation logic to CalRemoteAllocRatio()
- fix bugs in CalRemotePerLocal()
- remove ununsed variables in CalNrPagesLocalTotalPerPid()
---
 plugins/smap/src/user/manage/manage.c        | 167 ++++++++++++-------
 plugins/smap/test/user/manage/ManageTest.cpp |   1 +
 2 files changed, 106 insertions(+), 62 deletions(-)

